{"t_client_s": 17.496, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "91b0f4b43793", "seq": 39, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:08:05.676Z", "t_ms": 17292, "delta": "The available evidence does not answer roughly how many of the indexed papers carry the cs.MA tag"}}
{"t_client_s": 17.583, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "91b0f4b43793", "seq": 40, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:08:05.859Z", "t_ms": 17475, "delta": " because the database search timed out.\n\nRegarding MetaGPT, the authors define Standardized Operating Procedures (SOPs) and"}}
{"t_client_s": 17.741, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "91b0f4b43793", "seq": 41, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:08:06.016Z", "t_ms": 17632, "delta": " their implementation as follows:\n\n* **Concept and Coordination**: SOPs refer to well-established, domain-specific human collaborative workflows that coordinate task"}}
{"t_client_s": 17.889, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "91b0f4b43793", "seq": 42, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:08:06.165Z", "t_ms": 17782, "delta": " decomposition, define member responsibilities, and set standardized quality benchmarks for intermediate outputs [C1, C3].\n*"}}
{"t_client_s": 18.047, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "91b0f4b43793", "seq": 43, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:08:06.322Z", "t_ms": 17939, "delta": " **Prompt Encoding**: MetaGPT incorporates SOPs by encoding these established procedures into prompt sequences, creating structured assembly-line workflows instead of"}}
{"t_client_s": 18.23, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "91b0f4b43793", "seq": 44, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:08:06.506Z", "t_ms": 18122, "delta": " unconstrained dialogue [C1, C4].\n* **Role Specialization**: SOPs assign specialized human-like roles\u2014specifically"}}
{"t_client_s": 18.383, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "91b0f4b43793", "seq": 45, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:08:06.659Z", "t_ms": 18275, "delta": " Product Manager, Architect, Project Manager, Engineer, and QA Engineer\u2014each configured with dedicated profiles, goals, constraints,"}}
{"t_client_s": 18.5, "event": "token", "data": {"request_id": "91b0f4b43793", "seq": 46, "ts": "2026-10-28T01:08:06.772Z", "t_ms": 18389, "delta": " and operational tools [C2, C3].\n* **Sequential Handover and Structured Artifacts**: Following an SOP"}}
